**Exploring DCT optimization**

I’m considering the local DCT (Discrete Cosine Transform) and its performance given the planting amplitude periodicity. There’s a global parameter estimated at different phases. Using high-smoothness constraints might remove most false minima, though I wonder if there’s an exact threshold. I could optimize the coefficients by auto-selecting the DCT center frequency. The Galerkin low mode DCT10 with some random small coefficients might also provide insights, especially since we already have 40 low starts. Let’s analyze the full modes.
